{
  "uniqueId": "modelservice-1780379982192001893",
  "name": "minimax-m3",
  "displayName": "MiniMax M3",
  "provider": "MiniMax",
  "description": "MiniMax M3 is the first open-weights flagship that brings coding, agentic reasoning, million-token context, and native multimodality together in one model. It handles autonomous task decomposition, tool use, and multi-step reasoning with ease — and writes code that's meant to ship, not code that just runs. Built on MiniMax's proprietary Sparse Attention architecture, M3 natively supports million-token context windows for long-horizon agents, large codebases, and long-video understanding. Its multimodality isn't bolted on — it's trained in from day one, with text and vision deeply aligned at the semantic level.",
  "zhDescription": "MiniMax M3 是首个将代码能力、智能体推理、百万 token 上下文与原生多模态融为一体的开放权重旗舰模型。它能轻松完成自主任务拆解、工具调用与多步推理——写出的是可直接上线交付的代码，而非仅能跑通的代码。M3 基于 MiniMax 自研的稀疏注意力（Sparse Attention）架构，原生支持百万级 token 上下文，适用于长周期智能体、大型代码库与长视频理解。其多模态能力并非后期拼接，而是从第一天起便训练融入，实现文本与视觉在语义层面的深度对齐。",
  "longDescription": "MiniMax M3 is the first open-weights flagship that brings coding, agentic reasoning, million-token context, and native multimodality together in one model. It handles autonomous task decomposition, tool use, and multi-step reasoning with ease — and writes code that's meant to ship, not code that just runs. Built on MiniMax's proprietary Sparse Attention architecture, M3 natively supports million-token context windows for long-horizon agents, large codebases, and long-video understanding. Its multimodality isn't bolted on — it's trained in from day one, with text and vision deeply aligned at the semantic level.",
  "zhLongDescription": "MiniMax M3 是首个将代码能力、智能体推理、百万 token 上下文与原生多模态融为一体的开放权重旗舰模型。它能轻松完成自主任务拆解、工具调用与多步推理——写出的是可直接上线交付的代码，而非仅能跑通的代码。M3 基于 MiniMax 自研的稀疏注意力（Sparse Attention）架构，原生支持百万级 token 上下文，适用于长周期智能体、大型代码库与长视频理解。其多模态能力并非后期拼接，而是从第一天起便训练融入，实现文本与视觉在语义层面的深度对齐。",
